30,"end":34,"tooltip_key":"keyword:standardline"},{"start":52,"end":60,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":83,"end":87,"tooltip_key":"keyword:standardline"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","造成的伤害提升至240% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":16,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","造成的伤害提升至280% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":16,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","“执罚迅锋”期间阿塔利娅额外提升50点终结，且参与击败敌人或者释放终极技能后，立刻重置“执罚迅锋”的冷却时间。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":23,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"keyword:takedown"}]],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","降低敌人护盾的抵御值。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","技能“执罚迅锋”和“神圣斩击”还会击碎目标身上的护盾，击碎护盾的抵御值至多为自身800% ATK。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":40,"end":48,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","圣辉骑枪"]]}